OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain across parts of
OL,6,Fsouthern England and Wales will clear,
OL,7,Fleaving a largely dry day with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Elsewhere, rain and showers,
OL,9,Flocally heavy in eastern areas, will
OL,10,Fbecome more scattered later. Breezy
OL,11,Ffor many, with cooler temperatures,
OL,12,Fthough.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA few showers will affect
OL,15,Feastern Scotland and northeast England
OL,16,Fthis evening. Most areas then become
OL,17,Fdry with clear spells, before cloud
OL,18,Fand rain reach Northern Ireland and
OL,19,Fwestern Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
