OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FDry with sunny spells in the
OL,6,Fsouth. Northern areas see a few
OL,7,Fshowers initially, then rain spreads
OL,8,Feast later, heavy at times in western
OL,9,Fhills. Near-normal temperatures,
OL,10,Fwarmest south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
